{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>This third time</b><br>זאת קומתך [this is your stature]. [An allusion: and all of them with you are righteous.] Then the righteous will multiply; the righteous will flourish like a palm tree." "ושדיך [and your breasts]. [They are] masters of Torah, who will yield the fruit of [their] words."], :book :song-of-songs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 7, :notes {0 "The bracketed phrase זש״ה appears to be an abbreviation for זה שאמר הכתוב or similar; resolved as introducing a prooftext citation. The bracketed [ה] in הצדיקים is supplied from context.", 1 "The bracketed [הם] and [אמריה] are supplied interpretively; the Hebrew is extremely terse."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra's commentary on the Canticles" "http://beta.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH002030344/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:44:55.669275942Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}